order: a flex item's integer order lays it out and paints it in order-modified document order, stable among equal values
(CSS Flexbox 5.4). Grid auto-placement keeps document order, so a grid item with a non-zero order refuses.
CSS Flexbox 1: https://www.w3.org/TR/css-flexbox-1/#order-property

diff --git a/Include/RmlUi/Core/ID.h b/Include/RmlUi/Core/ID.h
